Patch-Source: https://github.com/bovigo/vfsStream/issues/299
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid deprecated spl_object_hash() on PHP 8.6

Use spl_object_id() where it is available while retaining the existing fallback
for PHP 7.1, which is still supported by vfsStream. Cast the object ID to a
string to preserve getResourceId()'s documented return value.

diff --git a/src/main/php/org/bovigo/vfs/vfsStreamFile.php b/src/main/php/org/bovigo/vfs/vfsStreamFile.php
--- a/src/main/php/org/bovigo/vfs/vfsStreamFile.php
+++ b/src/main/php/org/bovigo/vfs/vfsStreamFile.php
@@ -371,7 +371,7 @@ class vfsStreamFile extends vfsStreamAbstractContent
             $resource = $data['wrapper_data'];
         }
 
-        return spl_object_hash($resource);
+        return function_exists('spl_object_id') ? (string) spl_object_id($resource) : spl_object_hash($resource);
     }
 
     /**
